    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae Welcome to the prologue of The Riese Project</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A missing grandfather. A hotel with a past. Underground tunnels that refuse to stay buried.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201eI got you... Wait. I\u2019ve seen this place before.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anna returns to her family's old guesthouse in the Owl Mountains. Not for rest. For the truth.  <br>rapped in a room, with a fogged mirror and a phone call from her mother, she triggers a chain of events that lead straight to \u201cProjekt Riese\u201d \u2014 a real, unfinished Nazi complex buried deep beneath Lower Silesia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a free prologue of a narrative game where every click speaks. Every item means something. Every decision echoes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd0d What to expect?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f <strong>Anna speaks \u2014 you listen</strong>  <br>You\u2019re not a silent shell. You\u2019re the protagonist \u2014 sarcastic, stubborn, sharp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201eYesterday I was a quiet student. Today? A seasoned break-in artist.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>uzzles driven by context, not code</strong>  <br>Open grandpa\u2019s safe, find a hidden map, match piano tones to underground valves.  <br>You think like Anna. You feel like Anna. That\u2019s the key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Real location, digital obsession</strong>  <br>Hotel Szypr\u00f3wka, photogrammetry, Lumen, Nanite \u2014 but the spotlight isn\u2019t on tech. <strong>It\u2019s on touchable atmosphere.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>FPP or VR (OpenXR)</strong>  <br>Play your way: keyboard, controller, headset \u2014 everything works. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udd93 <strong>Free. No strings attached.</strong>  <br>This is just the first chapter of a larger story. Leave feedback. Help us shape what comes next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfaf For players who:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want <i>silence that hurts</i> more than jump scares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PRemember \u201cGone Home\u201d, \u201cFirewatch\u201d, \u201cEthan Carter\u201d \u2014 and want more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Own RTX, but value truth in pixels over realism for realism\u2019s sake.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd13 Not a tech demo. A trial by story.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The clock is ticking. Someone\u2019s walking up the stairs. And the map doesn\u2019t lie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201eBe a bull terrier. Be a storm. Be Jodie Foster in \u2018The Silence of the Lambs\u2019.\u201d</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udce5 DOWNLOAD NOW.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play. Review. Leave a trace. Help forge the full game.</strong>  <br><i>Because if not you \u2014 then who?</i></p>",
