rst chapter of a larger story. Leave feedback. Help us shape what comes next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfaf For players who:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want <i>silence that hurts</i> more than jump scares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PRemember \u201cGone Home\u201d, \u201cFirewatch\u201d, \u201cEthan Carter\u201d \u2014 and want more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Own RTX, but value truth in pixels over realism for realism\u2019s sake.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd13 Not a tech demo. A trial by story.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The clock is ticking. Someone\u2019s walking up the stairs. And the map doesn\u2019t lie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201eBe a bull terrier. Be a storm. Be Jodie Foster in \u2018The Silence of the Lambs\u2019.\u201d</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udce5 DOWNLOAD NOW.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play. Review. Leave a trace. Help forge the full game.</strong>  <br><i>Because if not you \u2014 then who?</i></p>",
